      "body": "## Purpose\n\nDisable all L4 jobs on CI by marking every step with `device: l4` in `.buildkite/test_areas/` as `optional: true` (37 steps across 14 files; the 3 L4 steps that were already optional are unchanged).\n\nOptional steps are not auto-selected on PR or main builds, but they stay listed in the **Run more jobs** input step, so they can still be run by hand. Re-enabling means removing the `optional: true # L4 CI disabled` lines.\n\nNotes:\n- No other step `depends_on` any of these L4 step keys, and none have AMD mirrors, so nothing else changes.\n- Nightly builds (`NIGHTLY=1`) select every step regardless of `optional`, so L4 jobs will still run in nightly.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- Parsed all `test_areas/*.yaml`, checked that every `device: l4` step now has `optional: true`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
